OL,3,AFather of A66 teen charged with funeral
OL,4,Aassault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of one of the five men who
OL,7,Fwere killed in a wrong-way crash with a
OL,8,Fpolice car has been charged with
OL,9,Fassaulting someone at his son's
OL,10,Ffuneral.
OL,12,FGye Worthy, 39, was arrested at
OL,13,FTeesside Crematorium in Middlesbrough
OL,14,Ffollowing a disturbance during the
OL,15,Fservice on Wednesday.
OL,17,FHis son Cole Worthy, 17, died when the
OL,18,FVolkswagon Passat he and four others
OL,19,Fwere in collided with a marked armed
OL,20,Fpolice car on the A66 in South Bank in
OL,21,Fthe early hours of 22 August.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
