OL,3,AFather of A66 teen charged with funeral
OL,4,Aassault
OL,5,
OL,6,FCleveland Police said Gye Worthy has
OL,7,Fbeen charged with common assault and
OL,8,Fobstructing police and is due to appear
OL,9,Fat Teesside Magistrates' Court in
OL,10,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
